    "Update Now downloads Paretly-unsigned.pkg into Downloads, shows it in Finder, and opens it in Installer. You install it yourself. If macOS blocks it, right-click the package and choose Open, or open System Settings > Privacy & Security and choose Open Anyway." : {
      "comment" : "Update",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「一键更新」会把 Paretly-unsigned.pkg 下载到「下载」文件夹，在访达里显示，并用「安装器」打开。需要你自己完成安装。如果系统拦截，请在安装包上右键选择「打开」，或到系统设置 > 隐私与安全性点「仍要打开」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「一鍵更新」會把 Paretly-unsigned.pkg 下載到「下載項目」檔案夾，在 Finder 裡顯示，並用「安裝程式」打開。需要你自己完成安裝。如果系統攔截，請在安裝包上按右鍵選擇「打開」，或到系統設定 > 隱私權與安全性點「仍要打開」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
